  "titulo": "Numbers from 1,000 to 1,000,000",
  "subtitulo": "Mil, dos mil, cien mil, un millón de pesos.",
  "foto": "t05.jpg",
  "regla": "1,000 is mil (never un mil), and mil never goes plural: dos mil, cien mil. Hundreds before mil agree with a feminine noun (doscientas mil personas). 1,000,000 is un millón, which does go plural (dos millones) and takes de before a noun (un millón de pesos).",
